{"4159680":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Barfender: CO-OP Bar Simulator","steam_appid":4159680,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4159680\/extras\/0954d528c3b792251abe8a1464ba9ac7.avif?t=1793628252\" width=1080 height=1350 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve drinks while your bar falls apart.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barfender<\/strong> is a chaotic co-op bar sim where fights break out, drinks spill, and you’re still trying to keep orders moving.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers get drunk, impatient, and start fights<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orders pile up faster than you can handle<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glasses shatter and the mess keeps spreading<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwanted guests wander in, thieves grab what they can<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve drinks, clean disasters, stop fights, and hold the bar together before it completely collapses.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve Under Pressure<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pour beers, shake cocktails, fake a smile, and mop up puke while the night spirals out of control.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4159680\/extras\/38ca568ea484706498b10bca76ae0d3b.poster.avif?t=1793628252\" aria-label=\"Serve Under Pressure\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4159680\/extras\/38ca568ea4847